Cephalon's engine package derives from VoidForge, previously named FrameHub
(Frame Hub), at https://github.com/StepTwo33/VoidForge, revision
e66896a0fa83b7336baaa5614d9fb7c8a7d61e88.

The source tree's LICENSE is GNU AGPL-3.0. Earlier versions were under MIT;
new contributions and the license change apply going forward. The upstream
package metadata still states MIT, which conflicts with its LICENSE; Cephalon
treats the source as AGPL-3.0.

The calculation code and catalog include material described as ported from an
earlier Dart project whose license is not stated in the available source.

